  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "`SummonEncDremoraLord` 10DDEE (the Dremora Lord summon, level 46; on *Summoned Dremora*) uses `EncDremoraMelee06` 016FF8 as its template but sets its own level, so changing the Valkynaz rung does not move it.",
      "`MGRDremoraSummon` and the three Arms of Chaos Dremora (rows above) take their template from `LCharDremoraMelee` / `LCharDremoraWarlock` without `Stats`, so they keep their own level when the rungs change.",
      "Dremora-race records (race 0131F0) with no template: `DA07VoiceMehrunesDagon` 0252AA (level 1; on *Unfiled NPCs*), `DA14Sanguine` 02E1F2 (level 1; on *Eastmarch Countryside*), `Malacath` 019E16 (level 100; on *Largashbur*), `ccPEWSSE002_SummonEncDremoraSovereign` 000850:ccpewsse002-armsofchaos.esl (level 60; on *Summoned Dremora*).",
      "The other rows: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Every other Dremora record (`DA07Dremora`, `DA14DremoraSummon`, `dunTransmogrifyDremora`, `dunLabyrinthianDremora`, `DA01LvlDremoraWarlock`, the `Lvl*` and `ccBGSSSE067_Lvl*Ambush` wrappers, `ccBGSSSE067_SummonEncDremoraLordScourge`) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
  },
